            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 10:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi yaaheesha ekinaabiro omu miringa, n'ekibunu kyakyo nakyo omu miringa; yaabiheesha omu miringa y'endeeberwamu z'abakazi, abaabaire bateerana kuheereza aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaakora ekibuga; aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo orugo rwakyo rukaba ruri orw'emikingo y'emyenda ya kitaani, oburaingwa bwarwo mikono igana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enyomyo zaayo ziri makumi abiri, n'ebiina byazo by'emiringa nabyo makumi abiri; kwonka eby'okuhanikaho eby'ahari ezo nyomyo n'obufunga bwabyo biri eby'efeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa bumosho oburaingwa bwarwo buri mikono igana, enyomyo zaarwo ziri makumi abiri, n'ebiina byazo by'emiringa makumi abiri, kwonka eby'okuhanikaho eby'aha nyomyo n'obufunga bwabyo biri eby'efeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba oburaingwa bw'emikingo bwaba mikono makumi ataano, n'enyomyo zaakyo ikumi, n'ebiina byazo ikumi; eby'okuhanikaho eby'aha nyomyo n'obufunga bwabyo biri eby'efeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omumaisho aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba obuhango bwarwo bukaba buri mikono makumi ataano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuhango bw'emikingo ey'aha rubaju rumwe rw'eirembo buri mikono ikumi n'etaano, enyomyo zaayo ishatu, n'ebiina byazo bishatu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "byaba bityo n'aha rubaju; aha rundi rubaju rw'eirembo oru na ruriya obuhango bw'emikingo bukaba buri mikono ikumi n'etaano, enyomyo zaayo ishatu, n'ebiina byazo bishatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emikingo yoona eyaabaire eyehinguririize ekibuga ekaba ekozirwe omu myenda ya kitaani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebiina by'okutamu enyomyo bikaba biri eby'emiringa; eby'okuhanikaho by'enyomyo n'obufunga bwazo biri eby'efeeza; n'emitwe yaazo eshwekirwe efeeza; n'enyomyo zoona ez'orugo rw'ekibuga zikaba ziine obufunga bw'efeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omukingo gw'eirembo ry'ekibuga gukaba gubaziirwemu ebicwererane by'ehuuzi za bururu na bujwa na karari na kitaani; obuhango bwagwo bukaba buri mikono makumi abiri, n'obwemi bwagwo buri mikono etaano, nibwingana n'emikingo y'orwo rugo rwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomyo zaagwo ziri ina, n'ebiina byazo by'emiringa bina; eby'okuhanikaho byazo biri eby'efeeza; emitwe yaazo eshwekirwe n'efeeza, n'obufunga bwazo buri obw'efeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi enkondo zoona ez'obutaaho n'ez'orugo orwabaire rwehinguririize ekibuga zikaba ziri ez'emiringa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu nigwo mubaro gw'ebintu byona ebyakozirwe ahabw'obutaaho, nibwo butaaho bw'Ebirikuhamya, nk'oku Musa yaaragiire ku bibarwa Abaleevi, abaabaire nibabibara, nibareebererwa Itamaari mwene Arooni omunyamurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bezaleeli mutabani wa Uuri mwene Huuri ow'omu ruganda rwa Yuda akakora byona, ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naakwatanisa na Oholiabu mwene Ahisamaaki, ow'omu ruganda rwa Daani, omusharuzi w'amabaare, omu nyamwoga omu by'emirimo, omubaziizi w'ebicwererane by'ehuuzi za bururu na bujwa na karari na bafuta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburemeezi bw'ezaabu zoona ezi baatoizire ahabw'okukora omurimo gwona ogw'Omwanya ogurikwera bukaba buri talanta makumi abiri na mwenda, na shekeli magana mushanju na makumi ashatu, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi oburemeezi bw'efeeza ezaahairwe ab'omu ihanga eryo abaabazirwe bukaba buri etalanta igana na shekeli rukumi na magana mushanju na makumi mushanju na itaano, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nizo zaahairwe abashaija obusiriira mukaaga n'enkumi ishatu na magana ataano na makumi ataano; buri mushaija owaagiire omu baabazirwe ahikize emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho akaba aha beeka emwe, nikyo kicweka kimwe kya kabiri kya shekeli nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezo talanta z'efeeza igana zikaba ziri ez'okuheeshamu ebiina by'embaaho z'Omwanya ogurikwera, n'eby'enyomyo z'omukingo, etalanta igana zirugwamu ebiina igana, ekiina kimwe etalanta emwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ezo shekeli rukumi na magana mushanju na makumi mushanju na itaano yaaziheeshamu eby'okuhanikaho eby'aha nyomyo n'obufunga bwazo, yaagaruka yaazishwekyesa emitwe y'ezo nyomyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi oburemeezi bw'emiringa ei baatoizire bukaba buri etalanta makumi mushanju na shekeli enkumi ibiri na magana ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egyo miringa yaagiheeshamu ebiina by'enyomyo z'omuryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, n'eitambiro ry'omuringa hamwe n'ekintu ky'emiringa ekishobeekaine nk'ekigoye, n'ebintu byaryo byona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.30",
